{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grim Diary is a rogue-like deck builder with anime art style.Currently on Early-Access</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/Lolo.png?t=1753092211\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/UI_3.png?t=1753092211\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Premise:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternate world following the protagonist Emi trying to bring back her sister\u2019s body back to normal after she\u2019s turned to a marionette to survive her sickness.Thus the start of their journey began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/UI_3.png?t=1753092211\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Game Tutorial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/Tutorial.gif?t=1753092211\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It will explain the basic mechanics of the game. This can be skip\u00a0 if players wanted to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Specifically made a tutorial to introduce even the players that don\u2019t any card or roguelike~like experience that want to try the genre. To hopefully encourage a variety of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/Header.png?t=1753092211\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combined with Visual Novel Elements and while experiencing the team based roguelike of Grim diary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/26.png?t=1753092211\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/27.png?t=1753092211\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bizarre Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's survival but has a unique gimmick on each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/UI_3.png?t=1753092211\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/_1_hand.png?t=1753092211\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/_4_meiboohucommsArt.png?t=1753092211\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">39+ Cards implemented In Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/Item_1.png?t=1753092211\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/Item_2.png?t=1753092211\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse